## Sign-in errors (dc-auth-client codes)
auth-error-invalid-issuer = The sign-in server address is not valid. Check the DC_AUTH_ISSUER setting.
auth-error-network = The sign-in service cannot be reached. Check the internet connection and try again.
auth-error-timeout = The sign-in service did not answer in time. Try again.
auth-error-discovery-failed = The sign-in service sent an unexpected answer. Try again later.
auth-error-listener-failed = DentalCraft could not wait for the browser on this computer. Restart DentalCraft and try again.
auth-error-callback-invalid = The browser came back with an invalid answer. Start the sign-in again.
auth-error-access-denied = The sign-in was declined in the browser.
auth-error-server-rejected = The sign-in service refused the request. Try again or contact support.
auth-error-invalid-grant = The sign-in expired. Sign in again.
auth-error-token-invalid = The sign-in could not be verified. Try again or contact support.
auth-error-cancelled = Sign-in cancelled.
auth-error-storage-unavailable = Signed in, but the system keyring is not available: you will need to sign in again next time.
auth-error-not-signed-in = You are not signed in.
auth-error-internal = Something went wrong during sign-in. Try again.

